{"author": "raymond91125", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete GO:0018279 protein N-linked glycosylation via asparagine\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/30880.\n\nTo be replaced by GO:0006487 protein N-linked glycosylation\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: \nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1eb7ryjsLEJSqtocexXLRh7mw6xeZhsdZL8DaiAF7IIE/edit?gid=0#gid=0\n\nImpacted groups: \nARUK-UCL\t2 automatic transfer\nCGD\t11\nFlyBase\t8 automatic transfer\nMGI\t1 automatic transfer\nPomBase\t17\nReactome\t4\nSGD\t1 automatic transfer\nTAIR\t12\nUniProt\t42 automatic transfer\nWB\t2 automatic transfer\ndictyBase\t1 automatic transfer\n\n** Group contacts: https://github.com/geneontology/go-site/blob/master/metadata/group-contacts.csv\n----\n\nMappings that need to be reviewed: (InterPro2GO, UniProt-Keywords, UniRule) \nterm\tfile\tline\nGO:0018279\treactome2go\tReactome:R-HSA-162699 > GO:protein N-linked glycosylation via asparagine ; GO:0018279\nGO:0018279\treactome2go\tReactome:R-HSA-446203 > GO:protein N-linked glycosylation via asparagine ; GO:0018279\nGO:0018279\treactome2go\tReactome:R-HSA-480985 > GO:protein N-linked glycosylation via asparagine ; GO:0018279\nGO:0018279\tunirule2go\tUniRule:UR000119531 > GO:protein N-linked glycosylation via asparagine ; GO:0018279\nGO:0018279\tinterpro2go\tInterPro:IPR005013 Dolichyl-diphosphooligosaccharide--protein glycosyltransferase 48kDa subunit > GO:protein N-linked glycosylation via asparagine ; GO:0018279\n\n\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2025-10-06T23:55:45Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "open", "state_reason": null, "title": "Review annotations to GO:0018279 protein N-linked glycosylation via asparagine", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2025-10-20T14:16:34Z"}
